# Repo-root ignores. Tool-local ignores (.venv, __pycache__, fixture scratch)
# live in tools/.gitignore and stay there.

# Reference imagery for the source-driven map pipeline. Previously local-only
# (third-party IP: GW cartography, a Total War screenshot mosaic, fan maps) and
# tracked only via tools/SOURCES.md's SHA-256 manifest + tools/registration/*.json.
# 2026-09-03: user decision — commit sources/ in full (private repo, tired of
# manually shifting ~2.3GB between devices), large binaries via Git LFS (see
# .gitattributes). SOURCES.md + registration/*.json remain the provenance record.
